==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Crimson Invasion|Zweilous|61}} from the {{TCG|Crimson Invasion}} expansion.
*'''Darkness Fang''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Unseen Forces|Umbreon ex|112}} from the {{TCG|EX Unseen Forces}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

